    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ref: 4068\nMost Attractive Four Bedroom Semi Detached Cottage In A Convenient Village Setting For Sale By Private Treaty\n\nLOCATION & DESCRIPTION: \nQUINN PROPERTY are delighted to present this beautiful four bedroom cottage to the market. Full of character and enjoying a wonderful village setting, this attractive home will appeal to a wide range of buyers. Ideally positioned in the village of Coolboy within walking distance of a pub, shop, community hall and Tinahely Riding Club, offering the convenience of village living while being surrounded by a beautiful countryside. Coolboy offers easy access to many surrounding towns and villages. Carnew is located just 7km away with a wide range of amenities to include primary and secondary schools, cafes, shops, restaurants, playground, nursing home and sporting facilities such as GAA grounds, soccer club and is in close proximity to Coolattin Golf Club. Carnew has a vibrant community and is close to both the Wexford and Carlow borders. It is 16km from Gorey and the N11, and 20km from the coast.\n\nThis deceptively spacious stone-built cottage, which was originally constructed in 1899, has been thoughtfully maintained and upgraded, and now presents in excellent condition. This property combines modern finishes with traditional charm, with beamed ceilings and a stone fireplace surround. Arranged over three floors, the main level offers a large living area, open plan kitchen/dining room, shower room and a bedroom with ensuite. To the basement level you will find a spacious second bedroom and multipurpose utility/office space. Upstairs there are two further bedrooms both enjoying charming vaulted ceilings, with bedroom four benefitting from an ensuite. \n\nAccommodation is bright and airy, extends to C. 121m² and comprises as follows: \n\nEntrance Hall:1.56m x 1.71m Tiled floor\nLiving Room:3.95m x 4.24m Laminate flooring, solid fuel stove with brick surround, stairs to first floor\nKitchen/Dining Room:4.19m x 4.09m Laminate floor, fitted units, dish washer, gas hob, electric oven, fridge freezer, solid fuel, boiler stove\nHall: 1.50mx 0.89m \nHallway: 2.00m x 2.70m \nShower Room:2.41m x 1.81m Marley flooring, W.C., W.H.B., shower\nBedroom 1:3.95m x 2.70m Laminate flooring\nEn-Suite: 3.36m x 1.79m W.C., W.H.B., Bidet, shower, fully tiled, heated towel rail, electric under floor heating\nUtility Room / Office:4.16m x 3.20m Tiled and laminate flooring\nBedroom 2:4.16m x 3.72m Laminate flooring\nBedroom 3:3.89mx 2.72m Timber flooring, beamed ceiling, walk in shower, hanging closet\nBedroom 4:3.89m x 2.71mTimber flooring, beamed ceiling, \nEnsuite: 1.33m x 0.77m W.C., W.H.B\n\nThe property offers an easily maintained garden, with a pebble driveway providing off street parking and a lawn to the front of the house. To the rear of the residence, there is a substantial concrete yard with separate access, offering potential for future development, subject to the necessary planning permission. The rear yard also features a traditional stone outbuilding, adding further character to the property.\n \nSERVICES AND FEATURES:\nMains Water\nMains Sewage\nGas Heating\nProperty Extends To: C. 121m2 \nBuilt: 1899\n \nBER DETAILS:\nBER: C\nBER No.: 119610731 \nEnergy Performance Indicator: 182.89 kWh/m²/yr\n\n A Timeless Cottage Offering Peaceful Living In The Heart Of Coolboy\n"
      },
